These 597 words define a separate presented group. GAP supplied the discovery
data; no transformation is trusted here. `Transfer` requires both the literal
relator identities and the three marked identities before constructing any
map to the original 101-generator carrier. Its independent finite bound is a
second input. See `source/README.md` for the two outstanding contracts.
-/

